 class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">对策池，必抽，RD有她就是碾压，以后估计RD难度都会下降不少，对策更多的为了克制隐藏boss</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">保底池<br></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/378617.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/378617.png\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">对策up宇宙池，不抽，钻多可以考虑，满破1刀25w<br></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/200903.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/200903.png\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">卖皮肤的，不抽<br></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/222693.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/222693.png\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">买皮肤的，不抽<br></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/515466.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/515466.png\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">RB宝石，不抽<br></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/284477.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/284477.png\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">RB宝石，不抽<br></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/508826.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/508826.png\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">血石池，不抽<br></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/55808.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/55808.png\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">垃圾发带，不抽<br></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/359868.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/359868.png\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">精选池，不抽<br></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/6/20/717100.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.co